      "description": "From Arch Wiki:\nAUR helpers automate usage of the Arch User Repository. In particular, they may automate the following tasks:searching for packages published on the AUR;resolving of dependencies between AUR packages;retrieve and build AUR packages;retrieve web content, such as user comments;submission of AUR packages.\nThis section tries to cover all these helpers, divided according to their functionality.",
